  unitName: Sylvan Excalibur Quaid
  unitId: 30566
  unitNumber: 891
  description: One of the sacred Guardians of Meirith. The reason why Quaid decided
    to stay behind in Ishgria was because there were still demons present which wanted
    to invade Grand Gaia, and because he believed his friends would protect Karna
    Masta. Just before the decisive battle against the demons, he told his dear friends
    to return home, which made them all furious. Moved by their concern for his well-being,
    Quaid set off to the battlefield smiling, though the result of the fight remains
    unknown. There are currently no records left behind about his party's return
    to Grand Gaia, nor about a demon invasion afterwards.
  summonDesc: I can't let down the friends<br>who helped me get this far.<br>I want
    to protect everyone!
  fusionDesc: I couldn't do anything back then,<br>but I won't chase my past anymore.<br>I'm
    grateful for your help!
  evoDesc: Don't worry, I'm here.<br>I'll always be by your side.<br>It's what I
    want, after all.
  element: 3
  rarity: 6
